      "extract": "[]{#sec:proof label=\"sec:proof\"} The connection between $p$-adic and finite polylogarithms is made by the following ::: proposition Let $\\operatorname{Li}^{(p)}_n(z):= \\operatorname{Li}_n(z)- \\operatorname{Li}_n(z^p)/p^n$. Then $\\operatorname{Li}^{(p)}_n(X) \\subset W$ and the function $\\operatorname{Li}^{(p)}_n$ reduces modulo $p$ to $(1-z^p)^{-1} \\operatorname{li}_n(z)$. ::: ::: proof *Proof.* According to",
